        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "CSR Assistant (previously known as back-up tech support) - Requires a minimum rating of \"Model\" (ME) for the prior 12 months; receives 50 cents per hour additional for time assigned this responsibility, which is paid as a lump sum at the end of each month. These duties are rotated on a high seniority basis of those Customer Service Representative II's who volunteer, up to a maximum of 10.",
