        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Office Support – (Business Office) requires a minimum rating of ME for the prior 12 months. Receives 50 cents per hour additional pay while assigned to this duty which is paid in a lump sum at the end of the month. These duties will be assigned for a six month rotation on a high seniority basis of those Customer Service Representative II's who volunteer within the particular location.",
